rsName><persName type="alt" xml:lang="bo-Latn-x-wylie">paN+Di ta sa dza na</persName><birth notBefore="1000-01-01" notAfter="1072-12-31">after 1000 before 1072</birth><death notBefore="1076-01-01" notAfter="1099-12-31">after 1076 before 1099</death><sex value="M"/><nationality>Indic</nationality><idno type="BDRC">https://purl.bdrc.io/resource/P4920</idno><idno type="APIS">3800</idno><note type="comment">Grand-son of Ratnavajra (ID:7726) ([BAQ9MH4T]: 406, n. 2).</note></person><person xml:id="person3977"><persName type="main" xml:lang="bo-Latn-x-wylie">mchims nam mkha' grags</persName><persName xml:lang="bo">མཆིམས་ནམ་མཁའ་གྲགས</persName><persName type="alt" xml:lang="bo-Latn-x-wylie">'chims nam mkha' grags</persName><persName type="alt" xml:lang="bo-Latn-x-wylie">dge slong nam mkha' grags</persName><persName type="alt" xml:lang="bo-Latn-x-wylie">shAkya'i btsun pa mchims</persName><persName type="alt" xml:lang="bo-Latn-x-wylie">'phyims nam mkha' grags</persName><birth notBefore="1210-01-01" notAfter="1210-12-31">1210</birth><death notBefore="1285-12-11" notAfter="1285-12-11">1285-12-11</death><sex value="M"/><nationality>Tibetan</nationality><idno type="BDRC">https://purl.bdrc.io/resource/P1060</idno><idno type="APIS">3977</idno><note type="comment">Seventh abbot of sNar thang monastery (ID:4411). On his dates see [2X2E3882]: 260, n. 146.</note></person><person xml:id="person4006"><persName type="main" xml:lang="bo-Latn-x-wylie">rigs pa'i ral gri</persName><persName xml:lang="bo">རིགས་པའི་རལ་གྲི</persName><persName type="alt" xml:lang="bo-Latn-x-wylie">dar ma rgyal mtshan</persName><persName type="alt" xml:lang="bo-Latn-x-wylie">chos kyi rgyal mtshan</persName><persName type="alt" xml:lang="bo-Latn-x-wylie">bcom ldan ral gri</persName><persName type="alt" xml:lang="bo-Latn-x-wylie">bcom ldan rigs pa'i ral gri</persName><persName type="alt" xml:lang="bo-Latn-x-wylie">rig pa'i ral gri</persName><persName type="alt" xml:lang="bo-Latn-x-wylie">bcom ldan rigs ral</persName><birth notBefore="1227-01-01" notAfter="1227-12-31">1227</birth><death notBefore="1305-08-29" notAfter="1305-08-29">1305-08-29</death><sex value="M"/><nationality>Tibetan</nationality><idno type="BDRC">https://purl.bdrc.io/resource/P1217</idno><idno type="APIS">4006</idno><note type="comment">On his career, see [KHA9ZVGP]: 3-8.&#13;
The dates 1227-1305 are known from the biography (see work (ID:7016)) composed by his student bSam gtan bzang po (ID:4005) ([KHA9ZVGP]: 3).&#13;
His name in religion was Dar ma rgyal mtshan or Chos kyi rgyal mtshan ([FZ6N88AU]: 406) - the name Chos kyi rgyal mtshan is given as his "real name" (mtshan dngos) in a homage by Rong ston ([KM47ZZDJ]: 657 and n. 62). &#13;
The majority of the colophons of his works name him "bCom ldan ral gri," a few "Rigs/Rig pa’i ral gri" or just "Ral gri." Schwabland's discussion of the variants “Rigs pa” and “Rig pa” does not come to a definite conclusion as to which is the correct spelling ([CTQMVBPR]: 2-3).&#13;
He was born as the son of a local wealthy headman, the fourth of five sons and his birth is reported to have been foretold by Śākyaśrībhadra (ID:6418) when he was invited by Ral gri's paternal uncle ([KHA9ZVGP]: 3).</note></person><person xml:id="person4062"><persName type="main" xml:lang="bo-Latn-x-wylie">skyi ston shAkya 'bum</persName><persName xml:lang="bo">སྐྱི་སྟོན་ཤཱཀྱ་འབུམ</persName><persName type="alt" xml:lang="bo-Latn-x-wylie">skyi ston shag 'bum</persName><birth notBefore="1200-01-01" notAfter="1200-12-31">1200</birth><sex value="M"/><nationality>Tibetan</nationality><idno type="BDRC">https://purl.bdrc.io/resource/P5741</idno><idno type="APIS">4062</idno></person><person xml:id="person4092"><persName type="main" xml:lang="bo-Latn-x-wylie">blo gros grags</persName><persName xml:lang="bo">བློ་གྲོས་གྲགས</persName><sex value="M"/><nationality>Tibetan</nationality><idno type="BDRC">https://purl.bdrc.io/resource/P0RK1758</idno><idno type="APIS">4092</idno></person><person xml:id="person4125"><persName type="main" xml:lang="bo-Latn-x-wylie">gha rung pa lha'i rgyal mtshan</persName><persName xml:lang="bo">གྷ་རུང་པ་ལྷའི་རྒྱལ་མཚན</persName><birth notBefore="1319-01-01" notAfter="1319-12-31">1319</birth><death notBefore="1401-01-01" notAfter="1401-12-31">1401</death><sex value="M"/><nationality>Tibetan</nationality><idno type="BDRC">https://purl.bdrc.io/resource/P2414</idno><idno type="APIS">4125</idno><note type="comment">Scholar associated with the Jo nang pa.</note></person><person xml:id="person4128"><persName type="main" xml:lang="bo-Latn-x-wylie">sa bzang ma ti paN chen blo gros rgyal mtshan</persName><persName xml:lang="bo">ས་བཟང་མ་ཏི་པཎ་ཆེན་བློ་གྲོས་རྒྱལ་མཚན</persName><persName type="alt" xml:lang="bo-Latn-x-wylie">bod kyi paNDita ma ti rha ja shri bha dra</persName><persName type="alt" xml:lang="bo-Latn-x-wylie">bod kyi pandita 'jam dbyangs blo gros</persName><persName type="alt" xml:lang="bo-Latn-x-wylie">sa bzang 'phags pa blo gros rgyal mtshan</persName