/P141</idno><idno type="APIS">4221</idno><note type="comment">[JZP4CZRX] distinguishes sKyi ston 'jam dbyangs (bdr:P141) and (skyi ston) Grags pa rgyal mtshan (bdr:P141). We consider here that they are the same person.</note></person><person xml:id="person4261"><persName type="main" xml:lang="bo-Latn-x-wylie">mchims brtson 'grus seng ge</persName><persName xml:lang="bo">མཆིམས་བརྩོན་འགྲུས་སེང་གེ</persName><persName type="alt" xml:lang="bo-Latn-x-wylie">'chims brtson 'grus seng ge</persName><persName type="alt" xml:lang="bo-Latn-x-wylie">mchims</persName><birth notAfter="1140-12-31">before 1140</birth><death notAfter="1220-12-31">before 1220</death><sex value="M"/><nationality>Tibetan</nationality><idno type="BDRC">https://purl.bdrc.io/resource/P10027</idno><idno type="BDRC">https://purl.bdrc.io/resource/P0RK1761</idno><idno type="APIS">4261</idno><note type="comment">We consider "'mchims brtson seng" to be the same person as "mchims brton 'grus seng ge."</note></person><person xml:id="person4593"><persName type="main" xml:lang="bo-Latn-x-wylie">Anonymous</persName><persName xml:lang="bo">ཨཱནོཉམོཨུས</persName><sex value="M"/><nationality>Tibetan</nationality><idno type="APIS">4593</idno></person><person xml:id="person6262"><persName type="main" xml:lang="bo-Latn-x-wylie">sthiramati</persName><persName type="alt" xml:lang="bo-Latn-x-wylie">slob dpon blo brtan</persName><sex value="M"/><nationality>Indic</nationality><idno type="BDRC">https://purl.bdrc.io/resource/P4CZ16794</idno><idno type="APIS">6262</idno></person><person xml:id="person6741"><persName type="main" xml:lang="bo-Latn-x-wylie">nya dbon kun dga' dpal</persName><persName xml:lang="bo">ཉ་དབོན་ཀུན་དགའ་དཔལ</persName><persName type="alt" xml:lang="bo-Latn-x-wylie">gnyag dbon kun dga' dpal ba</persName><birth notBefore="1285-01-01" notAfter="1285-12-31">1285</birth><death notBefore="1379-01-01" notAfter="1379-12-31">1379</death><sex value="M"/><nationality>Tibetan</nationality><idno type="BDRC">https://purl.bdr